# The build workflow parses models.tsv with `read` on Linux. A CRLF checkout would leave a
# trailing \r on the sha256 field and fail every checksum, so pin these to LF explicitly
# rather than relying on the contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
models.tsv text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
